# IndoWest AI chat server settings
#
# 1. Copy this file to a new file named ".env" in the same folder (chat-server/.env)
# 2. Paste your Google Gemini API key below (create one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
# 3. Start the server:  npm run chat-server
#
# The .env file is ignored by git, so the key is never committed.

GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional settings
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
# CHAT_PORT=3000
# Websites allowed to call this server (comma separated). Add your live domain when you deploy.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:4200,https://www.indowestunited.com
